  If we did have high bandwidth output not only could we talk/write faster
but we could use larger data structures. For example we could talk in
multimedia sound-taste-touch-smell-pictures. Plus we could output our
"memories" to external mass storage for flawless retreival later in
multimedia sound
-taste-touch-smell-pictures. 

   If it was easy enough (ie effortless) I'd want to output and observe
most of my thinking in real time in order to better see what I'm thinking.
(The "memories" wouldn't be memories until later but please ignore the
semantic problem for now). 

